LS, SEE SHEET B4-8.\P4. THE SOIL REINFORCEMENT ATTACHED TO THE BACKWALL SHALL BE DESIGNED BY A SPECIALTY ENGINEER FOR A SERVICE LOAD OF ___ K/FT AND A FACTORED LOAD OF ___ K/FT USING THE DESIGN CRITERIA FOR PERMANENT MSE WALLS. COST OF FURNISHING AND
  1
 INSTALLING THE SOIL REINFORCEMENT IS CONSIDERED INCIDENTAL TO THE COST OF THE END BENT.\P5. FOR REINFORCING BAR LIST, SEE SHEET B4-9.\P6. PILE OFFSETS ARE FROM THE PGL, + TO THE RIGHT LOOKING UP-STATION. CUTOFF ELEVATIONS ARE TO THE NEAREST 0.1 FT.
