\pxi-2.6,l2.6;1. TYP BAR AND STY ARE THE BAR TYPE AND HOOK STYLE OF STANDARD PLANS INDEX 415-001 (FY 2025-26): TYPE 1 STRAIGHT (B = LENGTH), TYPE 4 CLOSED STIRRUP (B = HEIGHT, C = WIDTH), TYPE 11 U-BAR (B = BASE, C AND D = LEGS); STYLE 5 = 135° STIRR
  3
UP HOOK.\P2. OPEN STIRRUPS HAVE THEIR END LEGS TURNED IN PLAN TO CLEAR THE PILE AND MATCH NO STANDARD TYPE; THEIR DIMENSION LETTERS REFER TO THE BENDING DIAGRAM ON THIS SHEET.\P3. LENGTHS ARE THE MODEL CENTERLINE LENGTHS ROUNDED TO THE NEAREST INCH; 
  3
BEND DIMENSIONS ARE OUT-TO-OUT (SDM 4.3.10.C).\P4. VARYING LENGTHS: END BENT 1 5D1: 6 @ 4'-11", 16 @ 5'-0", 16 @ 5'-1", 4 @ 5'-2". END BENT 2 5D1: 6 @ 4'-11", 16 @ 5'-0", 16 @ 5'-1", 4 @ 5'-2".\P5. PILES AND THE CHEEK LUG WELDED WIRE REINFORCEMENT AR
  1
E NOT INCLUDED IN THIS LIST.
